  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758894,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1.000 Miglia Volume I - 1927-1933 (Commodore 64)\n\nExperience the thrill of vintage motorsport with *1.000 Miglia Volume I - 1927-1933*, a challenging and visually striking driving game for the Commodore 64! Immerse yourself in the golden age of racing as you navigate the treacherous Italian roads of the legendary *1.000 Miglia* rally.\n\nThis game isn't just about speed; it's about precision and strategy. Master the handling of classic cars like the Alfa Romeo 6C and Maserati 26M, carefully managing your engine temperature and tire wear. Each stage presents unique challenges – narrow, winding roads, unpredictable terrain, and rival drivers vying for the lead. \n\n*1.000 Miglia* features stunning graphics for the C64, recreating the atmosphere of the era. The gameplay combines realistic driving mechanics with a touch of arcade action, demanding skill and quick reflexes. Relive the history of this iconic race and prove your driving prowess in *1.000 Miglia Volume I*!"
    },
